{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-virginia-tobacco","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Virginia Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the authentic and refined taste of traditional Virginia tobacco with Pod Salt Freebase Virginia Tobacco. This premium 60ml e-liquid offers earthy, slightly sweet tobacco notes with a smooth exhale. Available in 3mg and 6mg nicotine strengths, it delivers a satisfying throat hit and consistent flavor, packaged in a leak-proof Gorilla bottle for easy refilling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Classic Virginia Tobacco with earthy sweetness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg available\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreebase Formula: Smooth throat hit with rich vapor production\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991063601207,"sku":"Pod S - Virginia Tobacco - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991063633975,"sku":"Pod S - Virginia Tobacco - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-virginia-tobacco.webp?v=1763436983","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-virginia-tobacco","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




